# Provider API keys — optional, desktop only. .env is git-ignored; the in-app
# Settings view (desktop rail, right edge) is the primary way to configure AI.
# Each provider preset falls back to its env var when no key is saved in
# settings.json. The web app has no env store — its keys live in localStorage.
XAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
